WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.900
Water Beings · digital population
Seven generations reproduce through contact.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.500
First tank prototype · recorded from above
[A low sustained tone enters.]

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The smaller body protrudes farther from the opening.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.700
A strip of water opens between the two pale bodies.
[A second tone separates from the first.]

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.900
The large body turns. The smaller one travels around it.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.150
Second tank prototype · separate recording
Surface reflections cross the front glass.

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:56.150
Water Beings · digital population
[The low texture fades.]
